    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to \"define belonging on my own terms.\" i just want the weight to stop. i'm tired of the struggle and the pretending. it's like being a ghost in a world for the living. there's no point in finding my \"own terms\" if the world itself just feels so hostile and wrong for me. i just want some peace. i just want it all to be quiet.",
